    "type": "narration",
    "text": "481ぶふん2,147まどかの爆乳により宇宙の中心部の銀河群が轢き潰されていく。肌の表面で弾ける光一つ一つが銀河であり、おっぱいが揺れる衝撃でそれらがまとめて弾け飛んでいたが、まどかは気付きすらしない。",
    "source_lines": [
      {
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "481",
        "box": [
          1374,
          2052,
          1463,
          2087
        ],
        "action": "remove_translate",
        "translation": null
      },
      {
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "ぶふん",
        "box": [
          1226,
          2361,
          1426,
          2699
        ],
        "action": "remove_translate",
        "translation": null
      },
      {
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "2,147",
        "box": [
          1170,
          2682,
          1283,
          2717
        ],
        "action": "remove_translate",
        "translation": null
      },
      {
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "まどかの爆乳により宇宙の中心部の銀河群が轢き潰されていく。",
        "box": [
          973,
          2761,
          1745,
          2792
        ],
        "action": "remove_translate",
        "translation": null
      },
      {
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "肌の表面で弾ける光一つ一つが銀河であり、おっぱいが揺れる衝撃で",
        "box": [
          971,
          2792,
          1801,
          2827
        ],
        "action": "remove_translate",
        "translation": null
      },
      {
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "それらがまとめて弾け飛んでいたが、まどかは気付きすらしない。",
        "box": [
          973,
          2824,
          1759,
          2860
        ],
        "action": "remove_translate",
        "translation": null
      }
    ],
    "translation": "The explosion of 481 bubbles, 2,147 rounds, will destroy the galaxy clusters at the center of the universe. Each and every light that hits the surface of our skin is a galaxy, and it's shaking and it's flying together, but you don't even know it.",
    "context": {
